 for enhanced microservices architecture\n\n- Introduced new Dapr components including appconfig, binding, configuration, cron, lockstore, pubsub, resiliency, secretstore, state store, and vaultstore.\n- Implemented Helm templates for each component to facilitate deployment and configuration.\n- Added support for Redis and other cloud providers in pubsub and state store components.\n- Configured horizontal pod autoscaler (HPA) and pod disruption budgets (PDB) for better resource management.\n- Created service and ingress configurations for routing and service exposure.\n- Established role and role binding for secret access.\n- Updated values.yaml files for component configurations and defaults.\n- Added .helmignore and Chart.yaml for Helm chart management.", "tree": {"sha": "5dca4b568f74b96290361812ccd8cea886ce1892", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/miudetalles/helm-charts/git/trees/5dca4b568f74b96290361812ccd8cea886ce1892"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/miudetalles/helm-charts/git/commits/cf37048683d6abd0a7da49d2f05c7afba37dce7c", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": false, "reason": "unsigned", "signature": null, "payload": null, "verified_at": null}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/miudetalles/helm-charts/commits/cf37048683d6abd0a7da49d2f05c7afba37dce7c", "html_url": "https://github.com/miudetalles/helm-charts/commit/cf37048683d6abd0a7da49d2f05c7afba37dce7c", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/miudetalles/helm-charts/commits/cf37048683d6abd0a7da49d2f05c7afba37dce7c/comments", "author": {"login": "supermavster", "id": 20430676, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDMwNjc2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20430676?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/supermavster", "html_url": "https://github.com/supermavster", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/supermavster/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/supermavster/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://a